determnine the format of the forest products
transportation license.
The forest products transportation license shall
specify:
1° the identity of the licensee;
2° modes of transport such as the use of
vehicle, ship or air;
3° the number of the receipt of payment of
the license fee;
4° quantity of the forest products to be
transported;
5° loading point and the destination;
6° effective date of the license;
7° validity of the license.

